title: The Einwohnerwehr Disbanded
subtitle: Bavaria gives up its private army, on paper.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month = 6 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 8
on-arrival: {!
Q.civil_guards_dissolved = 1;
Q.civil_guards_strength = Math.min(Q.civil_guards_strength, 60);
Q.e21_dumps = 0;
!}

= The Einwohnerwehr Disbanded

Under the London Ultimatum the Reich must dissolve the civil guards. Gustav von Kahr's Bavarian government held out for months, and gives way in June. Nobody believes the Einwohnerwehr's rifles have been handed in. They are going to monasteries, estates and the cellars of Escherich's Orgesch.

On 9 June Karl Gareis, who led the Independents in the Bavarian Landtag and had exposed the secret arms dumps, was shot dead outside his house in Munich.

- @find: Send our railwaymen and carters to find the dumps.
- @reichstag: Table Gareis's list in the Reichstag.

@find
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Munich comrades think one dump in three can be found. Some of what we find need not reach the police.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids this kind of action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
if (Math.random() < 0.35) {
    Q.e21_dumps = 1;
    Q.red_guards_arms += 8;
    RG.district('bavaria', {guards: 1, militancy: 5});
} else {
    Q.e21_dumps = 2;
    RG.district('bavaria', {repression: 10});
    RG.news('Communists arrested for theft of arms in Upper Bavaria', 2);
}
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

Railwaymen, farmhands and carters report where the crates are going. [? if e21_dumps = 1 : A cellar near Rosenheim yields four hundred rifles. Half of them go to the police, as the law requires. ?][? if e21_dumps = 2 : The first dump they find is guarded, and a dozen of our men are arrested for theft of state property. ?]

@reichstag
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] We stand beside the SPD against Kahr. A few dumps will be emptied.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids common cause with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.civil_guards_strength -= 15;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Our deputies read out Gareis's list, with names and places, and the SPD votes with us. Kahr calls it proof that Berlin is in the hands of the Marxists.
